            "value" : "Sistem Dili"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language of Welp’s menus and windows. “System Language” follows your Mac." : {
      "comment" : "General setting explanation. “System Language” is the first option of the picker.",
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Welp'in menü ve pencerelerinin dili. “Sistem Dili” Mac'ini izler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The message is held this long; you can press “Undo” in the meantime." : {
      "comment" : "Behavior setting explanation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mesaj bu kadar bekletilir; bu sürede “Geri al”a basabilirsin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The offer is attached, let me know what you think." : {
      "comment" : "Made-up message shown in screenshots of the prompts.",
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Teklif ekte, ne düşündüğünü yazarsın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This message will go to a guarded chat:\n%@" : {
      "comment" : "Confirmation prompt. The argument is the chat, e.g. “Slack › Acme › general”.",
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu mesaj korunan sohbete gidecek:\n%@"
          }
